      "\\displaystyle=\\lambda^{-1}\\begin{pmatrix}\\delta^{2}(s_{2}^{2}+\\lambda)+\\left(1-\\delta^{2}\\right)(s_{1}^{2}+\\lambda)&amp;\\delta\\sqrt{1-\\delta^{2}}(s_{1}^{2}-s_{2}^{2})\\\\\n\\delta\\sqrt{1-\\delta^{2}}(s_{1}^{2}-s_{2}^{2})&amp;\\delta^{2}(s_{1}^{2}+\\lambda)+\\left(1-\\delta^{2}\\right)(s_{2}^{2}+\\lambda)\\\\\n\\end{pmatrix}"
    ]
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "id": "Pt0.A2.EGx34",
    "alttext": [
      "\\displaystyle\\mbox{\\boldmath$\\alpha$}^{\\star}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{\\lambda\\mathcal{W}(\\delta^{2}(\\lambda^{-1}s_{2}^{2}+1)+\\left(1-\\delta^{2}\\right)(\\lambda^{-1}s_{1}^{2}+1))}{\\delta^{2}(s_{2}^{2}+\\lambda)+\\left(1-\\delta^{2}\\right)(s_{1}^{2}+\\lambda)}&amp;\\frac{\\lambda\\mathcal{W}(\\delta^{2}(\\lambda^{-1}s_{1}^{2}+1)+\\left(1-\\delta^{2}\\right)(\\lambda^{-1}s_{2}^{2}+1))}{\\delta^{2}(s_{1}^{2}+\\lambda)+\\left(1-\\delta^{2}\\right)(s_{2}^{2}+\\lambda)}\\end{pmatrix}"
