      "\\displaystyle\\left.\\left(\\lambda+\\delta^{2}s_{2}^{2}-\\left(\\delta^{2}-1\\right)s_{1}^{2}+\\lambda e^{W\\left(\\frac{\\lambda+\\delta^{2}\\left(-s_{1}^{2}\\right)+\\delta^{2}s_{2}^{2}+s_{1}^{2}}{\\lambda}\\right)}\\right)\\right]^{-1}",
      "\\displaystyle\\hat{\\alpha}_{2}^{\\star}",
